      "status": "coded",
      "rationale": "The CSRM is a reusable CubeSat reference model and population structure, not a single-mission model. It provides reusable building blocks, a model-element library, and population guidance. The architecture is mission-agnostic and high-level because it is a logical architecture with abstract, generic, loosely defined components to be specialized by mission teams. Do not add interface-focused model or specific-mission model with reusable method only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "quote": "The CSRM is a SysML compliant and platform-independent model that provides building blocks that can be specialized to support CubeSat mission design.",
